{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced survivor-like bullet heaven where you unleash evolving weapons to wipe out massive hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your hero, craft your build, and survive relentless waves in intense, bullet-filled combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/d859038714e92f48056c8ef587d9d076.poster.avif?t=1773881436\" width=726 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/d859038714e92f48056c8ef587d9d076.webm?t=1773881436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/d859038714e92f48056c8ef587d9d076.mp4?t=1773881436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Content:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 distinct heroes, each with different strengths and starting weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 weapons in total, including hero-exclusive evolution paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 relics supporting diverse build strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 handcrafted stages with escalating difficulty     </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent hero progression \u2014 shape your growth beyond each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced build experimentation with treasure chests and experience boosts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable stages built for quick, intense runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3842860/extras/24c69538d9bf1a863cd20334c924694a.poster.avif?t=1773881436\" width=726 height=346 